# beads local-only files, no need to track
.local_version
last-touched

# Audit log. bd has no knob to disable it, and on a shared Dolt server it is a
# regenerated projection of the server-side `interactions` table — every write
# command rewrites it with EVERY actor's activity, not just this checkout's.
# Tracking it means an unrelated diff waiting in the tree after every bd write.
# The data is not lost: it lives in the database, queryable via `bd show <id>`.
interactions.jsonl
